==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|shrĭ'vəl}}, {{IPA|/ˈʃrɪvəl/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-shrivel.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪvəl|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|shrivels|shrivelling|pres_ptc_qual=UK|pres_ptc2=shriveling|pres_ptc2_qual=US|shrivelled|past_qual=UK|past2=shriveled|past2_qual=US}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[collapse]] inward; to [[crumble]].
#: ''I saw him '''shrivel''' on the ground in fear.''
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To become [[wrinkled]].
#: ''His fingers were '''shriveled''' from being in the bath for too long.''
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To draw into [[wrinkle]]s.
#: ''The hot sun '''shrivelled''' the leaves.''

